1
00:00:00,428 --> 00:00:01,838
(Howard(off):)Hey, Mike.

2
00:00:01,996 --> 00:00:03,066
(Howard(off):)Let me help you out, there.

3
00:00:03,231 --> 00:00:05,181
(Howard:)Thanks.
What's wrong with your mom?

4
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:06,573
(Howard:)Oh, her gout's flaring up.

5
00:00:06,734 --> 00:00:09,904
(Howard:)Turns out an apple pie a day
docs not keep the doctor away.

6
00:00:11,239 --> 00:00:14,149
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)How can
one little toe hurt so bad?

7
00:00:14,976 --> 00:00:19,186
(Howard:)Maybe because that little piggy
is being crushed by the barn!

8
00:00:20,982 --> 00:00:22,932
(Howard:)She should quiet down soon.

9
00:00:23,084 --> 00:00:26,084
(Howard:)I gave her enough pain meds
to choke a... well, her.

10
00:00:28,589 --> 00:00:30,429
I guess we're going to
have to do all the cooking.

11
00:00:30,591 --> 00:00:31,591
(Howard:)I have a better idea.

12
00:00:31,759 --> 00:00:32,929
(Bernadette:)If you think you're
going to make me

13
00:00:33,094 --> 00:00:34,364
(Bernadette:)do all this by myself,
you're crazy.

14
00:00:34,529 --> 00:00:36,199
I was going to make Raj
do it all by himself.

15
00:00:36,364 --> 00:00:37,844
(Bernadette:)Oh, well, that's a great idea.

16
00:00:40,701 --> 00:00:42,701
(Amy:)No traffic, we're sailing.

17
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:45,850
(Sheldon:)Yes. Like we're on a ship.

18
00:00:47,141 --> 00:00:49,551
(Sheldon:)Coming from Africa to America.

19
00:00:51,846 --> 00:00:54,346
(Amy:)Sheldon, that's
completely inappropriate.

20
00:00:54,515 --> 00:00:57,395
(Amy:)You can't keep comparing
yourself to a slave.

21
00:00:58,553 --> 00:01:03,023
(Sheldon:)Yes, Miss Amy.

